  "title": "Omalizumab vs Oral Immunotherapy for Multiple Food Allergies: Which Treatment Shows Better Results?",
  "summary": "Food allergies affect millions of children and adults worldwide, making everyday activities like grocery shopping, dining out, and attending social events stressful. For people with allergies to multiple foods, the challenges become even greater because avoiding several allergens at once significantly increases the risk of accidental exposure. A new randomized clinical trial published in JAMA Pediatrics compared two leading treatment options for multifood allergies: omalizumab and multiallergen",
